/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 654 Tm
() Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 636 Tm
(This project is an enterprise-style AI assistant hub. A user sends a request from a web) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 618 Tm
(UI, a backend agent coordinates the request, a model reasons about what the request) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 600 Tm
(means, and MCP-connected tools perform real actions when needed.) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 582 Tm
() Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 564 Tm
