/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 492 Tm
(• a backend for orchestration) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 474 Tm
(• an agent loop for reasoning and control flow) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 456 Tm
(• tools for external actions) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 438 Tm
(• MCP servers for standard tool access) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 420 Tm
(• guardrails for approvals and safety) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 402 Tm
(• observability for tracing and debugging) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 384 Tm
() Tj
